mc(3, 'biocontrol', 'Trichoderma species are', 'free-living fungi that act as biocontrol agents against several plant pathogens', ['bacteria that kill larvae', 'viruses of insects', 'nitrogen fixers'], 'They are common in the root ecosystem.');
