match(4, 'industrial', 'xm9', 'Acid and the microbe that produces it', ['A. Citric acid', 'B. Acetic acid', 'C. Butyric acid', 'D. Lactic acid'], ['p. <i>Clostridium butylicum</i>', 'q. <i>Lactobacillus</i>', 'r. <i>Aspergillus niger</i>', 's. <i>Acetobacter aceti</i>'], 'A-r, B-s, C-p, D-q', ['A-s, B-r, C-p, D-q', 'A-r, B-s, C-q, D-p', 'A-p, B-s, C-r, D-q'], 'Aspergillus niger (fungus) gives citric acid, Acetobacter acetic acid, Clostridium butyric acid and Lactobacillus lactic acid.');
